Tested versions\n\nUsing v4.6.dev.custom_build [c03bc2484].  Also happened with 4.5 (synced a bit before the official release).\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.6.dev (c03bc2484) - Windows 10 (build 19045) - Multi-window, 2 monitors - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3080 (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.8115) - AMD Ryzen 7 3700X 8-Core Processor (16 threads) - 15.95 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen enabling shader_baker on exporting a build, not only does it take significantly longer (took like an hour or two to get to 50%), but I can't seem to get my game to finish exporting at all.  It's been stuck at 99% for 2 days:\n\n<img width=\"1084\" height=\"843\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c4db6034-1e0f-494c-acac-4706af2e1e4b\" />\n\nWhen I debugged it previously, it seemed like there might have been some sort of deadlock happening.  I'll investigate further, but I wanted to go ahead and get the bug submitted since this is still happening in 4.6-dev.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nIn the export options, check \"Enabled\" under \"Shader Baker\".\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nI'm still trying to figure out a MRP.  Tried using some of my shaders in an MRP and didn't run into the issue.  Will try to make one in the future if I track down what's causing it.  I thought it had to do with shaders that used shader includes, but those do not seem to be causing a problem by themselves.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112794/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112794/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}